{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/47293725da07220c69d536e65b0e01ac.webp?t=1760111997\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>first-person, pixel-art space roguelike</strong> where every run is an adventure worth telling\u2026 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the helm of your spaceship, the only thing standing between you and an unpredictable galaxy is your mastery of the cockpit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your three crewmates have been given an impossible mission: contain the black holes spreading across the galaxy before everything collapses into nothingness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/5a0bbad948d36b0dc3eaa2d07c86ef96.poster.avif?t=1760111997\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/5a0bbad948d36b0dc3eaa2d07c86ef96.webm?t=1760111997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/5a0bbad948d36b0dc3eaa2d07c86ef96.mp4?t=1760111997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Your radio crackles: a distress call, a shady trader, a hostile ship. Every encounter is a choice, and every fight, a gamble. Hack, bargain, fight\u2026 or run?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEKI's</strong> <strong>combat system</strong> is as ruthless as it is strategic. Only pilots who understand the galaxy survive. Enemies have unique abilities that force you to adapt on the fly. Upgrade your modules, improvise with limited resources, and survive long enough to reach the next beacon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/e984632d002428ce7c7ad4f52f68269c.poster.avif?t=1760111997\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/e984632d002428ce7c7ad4f52f68269c.webm?t=1760111997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/e984632d002428ce7c7ad4f52f68269c.mp4?t=1760111997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your victory also depends on <strong>how you manage your scarce resources</strong>: myco-fuel, energy, scrap\u2026 Invest in combat modules? Save for the next station? Upgrade weapons or shields? Choose one enemy over another? Repair\u2026 or pray?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/89a9bf5cb749274283611b0b8a627e0d.webp?t=1760111997\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>first-person cockpit view</strong> that dares you to press every button (even the wrong one).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>tactical combat system</strong> that rewards bold decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radio encounters</strong> that reveal more about the universe and its inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable ship modules</strong> to combine and optimize during each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong>, because there are no second chances in space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One cockpit. Three crewmates. A thousand ways to die\u2026 and no run like the last.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome aboard BEKI. Do you copy?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025540?t=1760111997","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/bdae1583648d45e1b5126d8350c3f6429fd1e905/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760111997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/ebf4cc816999cc0f5ed3e5799acc954785bf9ab1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760111997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/ebf4cc816999cc0f5ed3e5799acc954785bf9ab1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760111997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/47293725da07220c69d536e65b0e01ac.webp?t=1760111997\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>first-person, pixel-art space roguelike</strong> where every run is an adventure worth telling\u2026 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the helm of your spaceship, the only thing standing between you and an unpredictable galaxy is your mastery of the cockpit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your three crewmates have been given an impossible mission: contain the black holes spreading across the galaxy before everything collapses into nothingness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_p