ry also depends on <strong>how you manage your scarce resources</strong>: myco-fuel, energy, scrap\u2026 Invest in combat modules? Save for the next station? Upgrade weapons or shields? Choose one enemy over another? Repair\u2026 or pray?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/extras/89a9bf5cb749274283611b0b8a627e0d.webp?t=1760111997\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>first-person cockpit view</strong> that dares you to press every button (even the wrong one).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>tactical combat system</strong> that rewards bold decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radio encounters</strong> that reveal more about the universe and its inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable ship modules</strong> to combine and optimize during each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong>, because there are no second chances in space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One cockpit. Three crewmates. A thousand ways to die\u2026 and no run like the last.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome aboard BEKI. Do you copy?</strong></p>","developers":["Two Tiny Dice"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025540/a9c30f5a68f074e49ab964b78fbbefd61c6343ac/header.jpg?t=1760111997","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"BEKI, Do You Copy?","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium III 1200Mhz /